                            <div class=\"review-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-8-1\" data-name=\"review header\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"check icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Review complete\n                            </div>\n                            The selected-context and message-attachment groups are visually distinct. Existing add/remove controls and upload flow remain unchanged.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"activity-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-9\" data-name=\"response label\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n                            Response\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"answer\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-10\" data-name=\"answer text\">\n                            Updated the composer hierarchy so project files read as persistent context, while uploaded documents and images remain scoped to the current message. The existing selection and removal controls are unchanged.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"message-tools\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-11\" data-name=\"message utility tools\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-11-1\" data-name=\"copy message button\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-11-1-1\" data-name=\"copy icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Copy\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"composer-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"composer footer area\">\n            <div class=\"composer\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"chat composer\">\n                <div class=\"context-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"context chip row\">\n                    <span class=\"context-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"context label\">\n                        Project context\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"chip\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"project file chip\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-file-code\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"file icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        ChatWindow.tsx\n                        <span class=\"x\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"remove chip button\">\n                            ×\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"chip\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"project file chip\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-file-code\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"file icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        FolderTree.tsx\n                        <span class=\"x\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"remove chip button\">\n                            ×\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"context-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4\" data-name=\"message context label\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">\n                        This message\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"chip doc\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-5\" data-name=\"document chip\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-file-text\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"file icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        README.md\n                        <span class=\"x\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"remove chip button\">\n                            ×\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"prompt\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"prompt text input\">\n                    Message… · /help for commands · Enter to send\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"composer-bar\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"composer toolbar\">\n                    <button class=\"model-select\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"model selection button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-cpu\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"cpu icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        qwen2.5-coder\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"chevron icon\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9298a4\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"attach\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"image attach button\" title=\"Attach image\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"photo icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"attach\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-3\" data-name=\"document attach button\" title=\"Attach document\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-paperclip\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"paperclip icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <span class=\"composer-spacer\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-4\" data-name=\"toolbar spacer\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"keyhint\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-5\" data-name=\"keyboard hint text\">\n                        Enter to send · Shift+Enter for a new line\n                    </span>\n                    <button class=\"send\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6\" data-name=\"send message button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"send icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Send\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"local-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"local note disclaimer\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-device-desktop\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"desktop icon\">\n                </i>\n                Running locally via Ollama · no data leaves your machine\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
